a&_nc_ohc=Hsz6C9JxuO0Q7kNvwFNHknq&_nc_oc=AdqbGjNewhjU7or7PHrTn84snZJuVQAhsHMv3zSCVMM9HBCZ6eu5FrJ5HcPt3267zCM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRl3KVuZj5FQjUiksB761AFDZ9sYALuOZ-VydTasqTEOA&oe=6AFB4739"}, {"file_name": "VideoWall_1.18.1.png", "id": "961945845417678", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974845_961945852084344_6533138472087779742_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bwMrqlmV15wQ7kNvwG3TZNy&_nc_oc=Ado8k_CHl1gQJUytAu8Z98nq733lHVcInGV9dUkY9AB7zHuCgQng__1hVnAgM9QfAfw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ73ALjEhYB8jErKB6I0yHgMhrT4CmUhs3gC8djbBhvGA&oe=6AFB20E5"}, {"file_name": "stepseq2_1.22.2.png", "id": "250093507859189", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982503_250093511192522_4388969349790307505_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0LajvQMNf34Q7kNvwH-rFJJ&_nc_oc=AdoTBeVlCtDJE4f3YY2PmZPB0smV6avqpO7lR4scbrEgKDsn8_HyYdK91pJfCPVfO00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTaK7V_NbhQztNXto_SHwTtD4nJWpxlT_iPAG0Cws99Bw&oe=6AFB4C88"}, {"file_name": "Session_1.23.1.png", "id": "795767698985101", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001732_795767702318434_262560137887527662_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lTkiWD6eHFwQ7kNvwH3XAf2&_nc_oc=AdqywKrKTD92MZ_orDoSFOkECLyCFlk_Qw9VrSAoyIiH1duJOyUyBmp5weaabRKUsWw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTBuWfz1OoSn0PViobrjp3AOHk7hU_M8Uqen3UoExTnKg&oe=6AFB2ABA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "tranzfirstframe.png", "id": "381471740929152", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_381471744262485_3617820370637424030_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-9lddy4LR-kQ7kNvwEzdCr_&_nc_oc=Adpy3XeRgQMxk_hPeWrdnsnf6ZYe7tcxKOotW0SIH5YjYPEJZo8J4Zv-ouHHjF5D--w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS7VEmmVTK6JQ1egK4bJ06ihE9wPW1f-c3FKg10aHU_FA&oe=6AFB45CE"}, "display_name": "Tranzient", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Make beats in VR - This is not a rhythm game!\n\nImmerse yourself in live looping and music production in VR.\n\n- Full support for hand tracking and mixed reality/passthrough \n- Synced looping with content library, auto time-stretched and pitch-shifted to fit the song.\n- Record vocals including mo-cap and replay of your avatar.\n- Use your custom Ready Player Me avatar.\n- Set of drum kits/one-shots.\n- Use Decks to create a seamless mix.\n- Full set of audio FX applied per clip or per scene (reverbs, chorus etc). \n- Loop record automation of audio FX parameters and synth parameters.\n- Assignable 3D control of FX and synth parameters.\n- Loop videos synced to the beat.\n- Step sequencer - trigger any item in the world and loop record instruments/drumkits. Edit steps, swing quantize.\n- Built in Analog Synth sim and Wavetable synth with >250 Sounds\n- Spatial Mixing - create a binaural mix based on clip positions.\n- In game camera and screen/mirror.\n\n\nIn the full version you get:\n- Built in 1.5 Gb library of loops and sounds\n- Use any number of synths (up to what the system can handle)\n- Use your own video and loops/samples\n- Export mixes of your performance\n- Lots more built in videos, VFX, Avatars and worlds.", "short_description": "The full version of Tranzient!\n\nMake beats in VR. Full live looping music production and sequencing environment in VR including visuals. \n\nThis is not a rhythm game.\n\nWho made the beats? You did!\n\nIn the full version you get:\n- Built in 1.5 Gb library of loops and sounds\n- Use any number of synths (up to what the system can handle)\n- Use your own video and loops/samples\n- Export mixes of your performance\n- Lots more built in videos, VFX, Avatars and worlds."}]}, "developer_name": null, "dev